{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI TALK 33 Car Robot Modavuj Market Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun business simulation where you can chat with AI customers, build and grow your own market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.poster.avif?t=1768478327\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.webm?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.mp4?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a small shop, you'll deal with the whims of fickle customers, stock shelves, set prices, and ultimately strive to grow into a massive grocery empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.poster.avif?t=1768478327\" width=640 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.webm?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.mp4?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 Shelf Management \u2013 \u200b\u200bDon't leave shelves empty, or customers will look at you like, &quot;Is this a market or a warehouse?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 Price Setting \u2013 Sell cheaply, and customers will be happy. Sell expensively, and your coffers will fill up. But be careful, overdoing it will make you trend on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Customer Relations \u2013 Clear the queue quickly and avoid impatient customers grumbling at the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Inventory Management \u2013 \u200b\u200bDon't let products run out; keep track of suppliers. Otherwise, customers leave empty-handed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Market Expansion \u2013 From a small market to a giant supermarket. Open new shelves and sell more products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Your Own Strategy \u2013 Whether you're a &quot;cheap hero&quot; or a &quot;high-priced but prestigious&quot; seller, it's your market, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? There's only one truth in this world: Empty shelves mean a tired customer. \ud83d\ude02</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4116770?t=1768478327","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/9f1b3d84a152e85617f04a2add1f72e999d0381a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768478327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/121f4c585c90c7a2f531a2bd09b67ddd5116ad83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768478327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/121f4c585c90c7a2f531a2bd09b67ddd5116ad83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768478327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Chat Speech-to-text","id":72},{"description":"Chat Text-to-speech","id":73},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4177780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI TALK 33 Car Robot Modavuj Market Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun business simulation where you can chat with AI customers, build and grow your own market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.poster.avif?t=1768478327\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.webm?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.mp4?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a small shop, you'll deal with the whims of fickle customers, stock shelves, set prices, and ultimately strive to grow into a massive grocery empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.poster.avif?t=1768478327\" width=640 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.webm?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.mp4?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 Shelf Management \u2013 \u200b\u200bDon't leave shelves empty, or customers will look at you like, &quot;Is this a market or a warehouse?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 Price Setting \u2013 Sell cheaply, and customers will be happy. Sell expensively, and your coffers will fill up. But be careful, overdoing it will make you trend on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Customer Relations \u2013 Clear the queue quickly and avoid impatient customers grumbling at the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Inventory Management \u2013 \u200b\u200bDon't let products run out; keep track of suppliers. Otherwise, customers leave empty-handed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Market Expansion \u2013 From a small market to a giant supermarket. Open new shelves and sell more products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Your Own Strategy \u2013 Whether you're a &quot;cheap hero&quot; or a &quot;high-priced but prestigious&quot; seller, it's your market, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? There's only one truth in this world: Empty shelves mean a tired customer. \ud83d\ude02</p>","developers":["Modavuj Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/cb9a3624288e97201d78f53a09fd381455b388ca/header.jpg?t=1768478327","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.s